error[E0507]: the run-time function `f` is applied in an erased position
  --> tests/cirkalang/fail/cap/forge_function.cirka:10:17
   |
10 |   r <- readFile (f ()) path
   |                 ^^^^^^
   = note: an erased value is never computed, so a call in it is never made: the function may panic or loop, and its result would prove anything
   = help: pass the proof at run time, or take the function with multiplicity 0 (its callers then show that it is total)
